The files in this directory (board map, card graphics, and related markers)
are derived from the official Twilight Struggle VASSAL module published for
use under GMT Games' electronically assisted gaming module terms.

From the GMT Games FAQ (https://www.gmtgames.com/t-faq.aspx):

  We provide or sanction electronically assisted gaming modules for items
  such as (but not restricted to) VASSAL, Cyberboard, Aide-de-Camp,
  Tabletop Simulator, Zuntzu, etc. as well as "Living Rules" for our games
  free of charge. We have only two restrictions on the use of these files:

  1. In order to legally use these files to play a game, at least one of
     the players must own a copy of the game upon which that module or
     files are based.

  2. All rights, copyrights, and trademarks of this page's Living Rules
     and the associated original games remain vested in GMT Games, LLC
     and/or the original game artists. We hereby grant permission for
     players to make photocopies of rules, playbooks, player aids, or
     other game-related content posted herein for personal, non-commercial
     use. Any use of these materials except for that express
     non-commercial use is prohibited without express permission from
     GMT Games, LLC.

